path=["caption"] value="Overview of the proposed G-Retriever : 1) Indexing: Graphs are indexed for efficient query processing; 2) Retrieval: The most semantically relevant nodes and edges are retrieved, conditioned on the query; 3) Subgraph Construction: A connected subgraph is extracted, covering as many relevant nodes and edges as possible while maintaining a manageable graph size; 4) Generation: An answer is generated using a ‘graph prompt’, a textualized graph, and the query."
